     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "generated" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem ng-hiv-eac-register-virologic-failure-cause-cs</b></p><a name=\"ng-hiv-eac-register-virologic-failure-cause-cs\"> </a><a name=\"hcng-hiv-eac-register-virologic-failure-cause-cs\"> </a><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>https://fhir-ig.digitalhealth.gov.ng/CodeSystem/ng-hiv-eac-register-virologic-failure-cause-cs</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">1a<a name=\"ng-hiv-eac-register-virologic-failure-cause-cs-1a\"> </a></td><td>Missed doses</td><td>The client missed one or more ART doses.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">1b<a name=\"ng-hiv-eac-register-virologic-failure-cause-cs-1b\"> </a></td><td>Abnormal or irregular dosing frequency</td><td>The client took ART at an abnormal or irregular frequency.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">2a<a name=\"ng-hiv-eac-register-virologic-failure-cause-cs-2a\"> </a></td><td>Drug–drug interaction</td><td>A drug–drug interaction is suspected to have contributed to virologic failure.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">2b<a name=\"ng-hiv-eac-register-virologic-failure-cause-cs-2b\"> </a></td><td>Drug–herb interaction</td><td>A drug–herb interaction is suspected to have contributed to virologic failure.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">2c<a name=\"ng-hiv-eac-register-virologic-failure-cause-cs-2c\"> </a></td><td>Drug–substance interaction</td><td>A drug–substance interaction is suspected to have contributed to virologic failure.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">3<a name=\"ng-hiv-eac-register-virologic-failure-cause-cs-3\"> </a></td><td>Other suspected cause</td><td>A suspected cause not represented by another register code; describe it separately.</td></tr></table></div>"
